com scikit-learn 1.8.0 (versao fixada) aprova as 29 metricas. A gravacao sob web/, motor_cenarios/saida,
output-publicavel e output-historico e recusada.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
